## Do

- **Fonts:** Root Inter only (`display: swap`, preload). Customize/stamp fonts stay off `/` (`GoogleFontsLinks`).
- **JS:** `dynamic` / deferred Swiper (`LazyHomeSwiper`); avoid new whole-route `'use client'` weight on `/`.
- **Images:** Prefer CMS WebP under budgets; product AI `encodeStorefrontWebp`; Unsplash via `optimizeStorefrontImageUrl`.
- **Video hero:** Mobile LCP should prefer **fallback/poster WebP**; avoid forcing full MP4 into critical path when practical.
- **Cache:** `/_next/static` immutable; `/images`, `/media`, logo/apple-touch = 1d + SWR; public site-config `s-maxage=60` SWR 300 (catalog/media public already 60/300). HTML home may stay `no-store`. Do not blanket-`no-store` public CMS/catalog.
- **A11y:** Icon `aria-label`s + video captions; hero/category copy on dark scrim (avoid `text-transparent`/`bg-clip-text` for body copy); footer `text-gray-300` on `bg-gray-900`.
- **3rd parties:** No new render-blocking scripts in root layout.

## Do not

- Redesign Hero logo / HOT ITEM / Framer / brand gradients (text readability scrim behind titles is OK).
- Pull accounting-sandbox into storefront webpack.
- Treat only desktop; assume Moto G / Slow 4G.
- Claim wins from a **1:33 baseline** paste — use latest PSI time (**4:58**).

